# Copy this file to googleapikey.env and fill in the key.
# googleapikey.env is gitignored; this example is not.
#
# Get a key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Without it the app still runs: alt text is skipped, labels are left alone,
# and colours are chosen by the deterministic fallback instead of the model.
GEMAPI=
